OL,3,GNEWSASenedd member Sarah Cooper-Lesadd
OL,4,Aquits Reform to join Plaid Cymru
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the Senedd has quit Reform
OL,7,Fand joined Plaid Cymru, saying Reform
OL,8,Fhas "no interest in Wales".
OL,10,FSarah Cooper-Lesadd's defection was
OL,11,Fapproved by Plaid's Senedd group and
OL,12,Fnational executive on Tuesday.
OL,14,FIt means Plaid, which won May's Senedd
OL,15,Felection, now has 44 members, leaving
OL,16,FReform ` the largest opposition party `
OL,17,Fwith 33 seats.
OL,19,FCooper-Lesadd, a former Conservative,
OL,20,Fwas elected for the Pen-y-bont Bro
OL,21,FMorgannwg constituency.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
